299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In today's cutthroat industry, hiring candidates with manual resume verification is a very challenging task. This work is an experimental approach because the hiring staff finds it challenging to manually evaluate applications because it takes more time to review each candidate's resume. If there are many resumes, there will be more workers for the same task.A new strategy has been introduced to deal with these problems. To increase the efficiency of the entire hiring process, a machine learning-based resume processing application is recommended. This task uses strategies like ranking the candidates and optimizing their performance in the requested skill listed on the resume to display the selected applicants based on their overall performance in line with the skill requirements of the company's desired employment position. To verify that the data supplied by the user is correct, the course completion certificate for the user's chosen abilities will be reviewed. Candidates are ranked, user skills are optimized, and resume facts are verified using machine learning algorithms.Python is used to implement the entire concept, and the outcomes will undoubtedly make the hiring process more effective.)
/E (In today's cutthroat industry, hiring candidates with manual resume verification is a very challenging task. This work is an experimental approach because the hiring staff finds it challenging to manually evaluate applications because it takes more time to review each candidate's resume. If there are many resumes, there will be more workers for the same task.A new strategy has been introduced to deal with these problems. To increase the efficiency of the entire hiring process, a machine learning-based resume processing application is recommended. This task uses strategies like ranking the candidates and optimizing their performance in the requested skill listed on the resume to display the selected applicants based on their overall performance in line with the skill requirements of the company's desired employment position. To verify that the data supplied by the user is correct, the course completion certificate for the user's chosen abilities will be reviewed. Candidates are ranked, user skills are optimized, and resume facts are verified using machine learning algorithms.Python is used to implement the entire concept, and the outcomes will undoubtedly make the hiring process more effective.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
