<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Recruitment and selection is considered one of the most significant aspects of People Management in the contemporary business environment. Whether an organization will succeed or fail is largely determined by whether it has the right people in the right jobs. Traditionally, hiring as an activity has relied upon human judgment, intuition and qualitative assessment of candidates. Unfortunately, this approach is often subject to subjectivity, inconsistency, and bias which could lead to poor quality hiring and lowered efficacy and effectiveness of the organization.)
/E (Recruitment and selection is considered one of the most significant aspects of People Management in the contemporary business environment. Whether an organization will succeed or fail is largely determined by whether it has the right people in the right jobs. Traditionally, hiring as an activity has relied upon human judgment, intuition and qualitative assessment of candidates. Unfortunately, this approach is often subject to subjectivity, inconsistency, and bias which could lead to poor quality hiring and lowered efficacy and effectiveness of the organization.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (As many organizations embrace the rapid evolution of data science, machine learning, and artificial intelligence, there is an evident shift towards data-focused approaches that will impact HR functions. In this space, data analytics in recruiting has emerged as an innovator, allowing organizations to access past hiring data, identify trends, and make decisions based on hard evidence. This process leads to better hires and creates a fair and transparent process for assessing candidates.)
/E (As many organizations embrace the rapid evolution of data science, machine learning, and artificial intelligence, there is an evident shift towards data-focused approaches that will impact HR functions. In this space, data analytics in recruiting has emerged as an innovator, allowing organizations to access past hiring data, identify trends, and make decisions based on hard evidence. This process leads to better hires and creates a fair and transparent process for assessing candidates.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The project "Hiring Driven by Data Insights of the Applicants" seeks to examine the impact of measurable candidate characteristics \(education, experience, skill test results, and interview scores\) on hiring outcomes. Using an actual recruitment dataset from Kaggle, this study will analyze how machine learning can predict hiring decisions and identify the characteristics that matter when making hiring decisions.)
/E (The project "Hiring Driven by Data Insights of the Applicants" seeks to examine the impact of measurable candidate characteristics \(education, experience, skill test results, and interview scores\) on hiring outcomes. Using an actual recruitment dataset from Kaggle, this study will analyze how machine learning can predict hiring decisions and identify the characteristics that matter when making hiring decisions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
