/S /H3
/T (More and more, organizations are relying on data-driven approaches to make their HR decisions more consistent and based on solid evidence. Traditional hiring practices, which often depend on interviews, resumes, and recruiters' gut feelings, can fall victim to subjectivity and lead to inconsistent results. To tackle these issues, both researchers and professionals have been investigating how analytics and machine learning can help predict which candidates are likely to succeed and streamline the selection process.)
/E (More and more, organizations are relying on data-driven approaches to make their HR decisions more consistent and based on solid evidence. Traditional hiring practices, which often depend on interviews, resumes, and recruiters' gut feelings, can fall victim to subjectivity and lead to inconsistent results. To tackle these issues, both researchers and professionals have been investigating how analytics and machine learning can help predict which candidates are likely to succeed and streamline the selection process.)
