/T (8.1 Objective This section describes the supervised learning workflow used to build predictive classifiers for the binary outcome HiringDecision. The aim is to \(a\) construct reproducible pipelines that transform cleaned resume-derived features into model-ready inputs, \(b\) train and tune several classifier families to identify the best-performing method, and \(c\) produce interpretable artifacts \(feature rankings and explanation tools\) to inform HR decisions. The detailed numerical evaluation and interpretation of model outputs are presented in Section 6 \(Results & Interpretation\).)
/E (8.1 Objective This section describes the supervised learning workflow used to build predictive classifiers for the binary outcome HiringDecision. The aim is to \(a\) construct reproducible pipelines that transform cleaned resume-derived features into model-ready inputs, \(b\) train and tune several classifier families to identify the best-performing method, and \(c\) produce interpretable artifacts \(feature rankings and explanation tools\) to inform HR decisions. The detailed numerical evaluation and interpretation of model outputs are presented in Section 6 \(Results & Interpretation\).)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [1]
>>
