/T (8.2 Input features and train/test split Model inputs use the preprocessed set of predictors selected after EDA and hypothesis testing: EducationLevel, RecruitmentStrategy, InterviewScore, PersonalityScore, ExperienceYears, and SkillScore. The original dataset was partitioned into a held-out test set \(n = 300\) and a training set used for cross-validation and resampling. The hold-out test set is reserved for final evaluation and is not used in any resampling or hyperparameter search to ensure unbiased performance estimates.)
/E (8.2 Input features and train/test split Model inputs use the preprocessed set of predictors selected after EDA and hypothesis testing: EducationLevel, RecruitmentStrategy, InterviewScore, PersonalityScore, ExperienceYears, and SkillScore. The original dataset was partitioned into a held-out test set \(n = 300\) and a training set used for cross-validation and resampling. The hold-out test set is reserved for final evaluation and is not used in any resampling or hyperparameter search to ensure unbiased performance estimates.)
