/T (Interpretation of model comparison: SVM delivered the highest predictive performance on the held-out test set \(highest accuracy and balanced precision/recall across classes\). KNN also performs well but with slightly lower class-1 precision. Logistic regression is the weakest of the three in overall accuracy and class-1 precision, though recall for hires remains acceptable. These results indicate the signal in the selected features is strong and non-linear decision boundaries \(SVM/RBF\) capture it best.)
/E (Interpretation of model comparison: SVM delivered the highest predictive performance on the held-out test set \(highest accuracy and balanced precision/recall across classes\). KNN also performs well but with slightly lower class-1 precision. Logistic regression is the weakest of the three in overall accuracy and class-1 precision, though recall for hires remains acceptable. These results indicate the signal in the selected features is strong and non-linear decision boundaries \(SVM/RBF\) capture it best.)
