/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (6.7 Recommendations & next steps 1. Use SVM \(RBF\) as the primary classifier for pilot deployment, but perform probability calibration and threshold tuning to meet HR risk/recall tradeoffs. 2. Implement explainability checks \(SHAP/LIME\) to surface which features drive individual decisions and ensure transparency. 3. Audit recruitment channels and run controlled experiments \(A/B\) to confirm causal effects rather than correlations. 4. Collect more labeled data across roles and time; validate model performance prospectively and monitor drift. 5. Consider ensemble / stacking and feature-level improvements \(textual resume features, interviewer IDs, role-specific scores\) to further improve accuracy and robustness.)
/E (6.7 Recommendations & next steps 1. Use SVM \(RBF\) as the primary classifier for pilot deployment, but perform probability calibration and threshold tuning to meet HR risk/recall tradeoffs. 2. Implement explainability checks \(SHAP/LIME\) to surface which features drive individual decisions and ensure transparency. 3. Audit recruitment channels and run controlled experiments \(A/B\) to confirm causal effects rather than correlations. 4. Collect more labeled data across roles and time; validate model performance prospectively and monitor drift. 5. Consider ensemble / stacking and feature-level improvements \(textual resume features, interviewer IDs, role-specific scores\) to further improve accuracy and robustness.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
