/T (6.8 Concluding statement The analysis demonstrates that objective measures of candidate skill and interview performance, together with education and experience, strongly predict hiring decisions in this dataset. A well-tuned SVM classifier achieves ~91% accuracy on held-out data and can be a useful decision-support tool for HR after careful calibration, fairness checks, and prospective validation.)
/E (6.8 Concluding statement The analysis demonstrates that objective measures of candidate skill and interview performance, together with education and experience, strongly predict hiring decisions in this dataset. A well-tuned SVM classifier achieves ~91% accuracy on held-out data and can be a useful decision-support tool for HR after careful calibration, fairness checks, and prospective validation.)
